<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-NZ M-3 money supply rises 0.5 pct in June.</title>
<headline>TABLE-NZ M-3 money supply rises 0.5 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Thursday released the following estimated money supply figures for June.</p>
<p>    M3		    June 1997     May 1997	June 1996</p>
<p>    mthly change	 +0.5 pct     -2.1 pct	+1.8 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    +1.8 pct     +3.0 pct     +18.1 pct</p>
<p>PSC</p>
<p>    mthly change	 +1.1 pct     +0.3 pct	+1.5 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    +9.2 pct     +9.6 pct     +16.6 pct</p>
<p>M1</p>
<p>    mthly change	 -2.1 pct    +3.5 pct	 -1.2 pct</p>
<p>    yr-on-yr change    +8.6 pct    +9.7 pct	 +0.6 pct</p>
<p>-- Welington Newsroom 64 4 4714 273</p>
<p>	 e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
